  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Fused Latin-Sinitic, ascending; titles blend the two (Latin castellanus/comes/dux/princeps/rex/imperator + Chinese nan/dudu/bo/hou/gong/wang/huangdi). Castelnan (castellan-baron) barony; Limitudu (march-commander) march; Combo (count) county; Duxou (duke-marquis) duchy; Princong (prince-duke) principality; Rexwang (king) kingdom; Imperdi (emperor, holding the Mandate) over the Imperdium. The legions (legio) and the celestial magistracy serve the throne. (Rank titles fuse the real Latin/Chinese register, allowed.)",
